P5-5 Colab Batch Asset Factory - Planning
========================================

Structure:
- colab/worker.py        : Colab runner (reads tasks, dispatches, zips outputs)
- colab/worker.ipynb     : notebook wrapper
- engine/workers/colab_dispatch.py  : local scheduler
- engine/workers/colab_harvest.py   : local harvester

Task exchange dir (local):
- working/_colab_tasks/      (queued tasks JSON)
- working/_colab_inbox/      (downloaded zips from Colab)
- working/_colab_out/        (extracted results)

Extensible: add new task_type + handler.
Targets: image_gen, video_broll_fetch, batch_rebuild.
